It includes, unchanged, files from the qlm-measure repository
(https://github.com/quantumlearningmachines/qlm-measure). vendor/PROVENANCE.json
names each file, its source path, the commit and its SHA-256.

- vendor/qlm-measure/: the qlm-measure 0.9.0 verifier build. Apache-2.0.
- vendor/transformer/: the QLM transformer engine. MIT; its license is in
  vendor/transformer/LICENSE.txt and is kept with those files.
- data/samples/tutormoments-real-transcripts.jsonl and the TutorMoments
  sample embedded in vendor/transformer/profiles.mjs: excerpts of
  TutorMoments-Preview, Albert Zhang and colleagues, Ai2 and collaborators
  (2026), https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/tutormoments-preview,
  revision 3bb0c104d65e29facffca7ba864ef10fa22d0e78. CC BY 4.0.
- data/samples/oatutor-real-participants.csv and the OATutor sample embedded
  in vendor/transformer/profiles.mjs: an excerpt of Pardos and Bhandari
  (2023), https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.23935269.v1. CC BY 4.0.
- data/samples/explicit-assistance-SYNTHETIC.jsonl and data/examples/: QLM's
  synthetic fixtures and test vectors. No learner data.
- data/preprint/ and vendor/transformer/cross-source-analysis-data.mjs:
  aggregate counts published with the Learnlog preprint. No learner rows.

The selection, attribution and limits of each excerpt are in
data/THIRD_PARTY_DATA.md and data/provenance/. No source author endorses this
software.
